    <oops:hasDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An ontology element is used as a class without having been explicitly declared as such using the primitives owl:Class or rdfs:Class. This pitfall is related with the common problems listed in [8].	</oops:hasDescription>
